@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Replace this placeholder with a currently configured free model from /api/models.
@cloudModel = vendor/model:free

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Configured models
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/models

### Local generation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"qwen3:4b","prompt":"Explain REST in one sentence. /no_think"}

### Cloud generation (configure OpenRouter environment first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"{{cloudModel}}","prompt":"Explain REST in one sentence."}

### Comparison (configure two models first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{"models":["qwen3:4b","{{cloudModel}}"],"prompt":"Explain REST in one sentence."}

### History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs?page=0&size=20

### Expected validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"qwen3:4b","prompt":" "}
